  <metadata>
    <name>RI-19 · Fernie–Flathead historic loop</name>
    <desc>The classic Flathead–Corbin–Cabin–Wigwam loop is no longer continuous because of washouts and removed bridges. Coarse corridor geometry; not a turn-by-turn track. Verify land access, closures, gates, weather and field signage.</desc>
    <time>2026-09-09T00:00:00Z</time>
  </metadata>
